<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>Assassino Verde - RPG App</title>
    
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    
    <!-- FontAwesome for Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@600;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Custom Tailwind Configuration & CSS -->
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
                        title: ['Cinzel', 'serif'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        rpg: {
                            dark: '#0f172a',
                            panel: '#1e293b',
                            emerald: '#10b981',
                            blood: '#e11d48'
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #020617; /* Slate 950 */
            color: #f8fafc; /* Slate 50 */
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        /* Ocultar barra de rolagem mas manter funcionalidade */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 0px;
            background: transparent;
        }

        .tab-content {
            display: none;
            animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-in-out;
        }
        .tab-content.active {
            display: block;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        /* Estilo para os círculos de recursos (Fúria/Dados de vida) */
        .resource-dot {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid #10b981;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
        }
        .resource-dot.active {
            background-color: #10b981;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5);
            color: #020617;
        }
        .resource-dot.used {
            border-color: #475569;
            background-color: transparent;
            box-shadow: none;
            opacity: 0.5;
        }
        .resource-dot i { display: none; }
        .resource-dot.active i { display: block; font-size: 0.8rem; }

        /* Modal Styles */
        .modal-overlay {
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        }
        .modal-overlay.show {
            opacity: 1;
            pointer-events: auto;
        }
        .modal-content {
            transform: scale(0.9);
            transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
        }
        .modal-overlay.show .modal-content {
            transform: scale(1);
        }

        /* Animação do Dado 3D / Bouncing */
        .dice-overlay {
            position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 60; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
            display: none; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        }
        .dice-overlay.active { display: flex; }
        
        .dice-container {
            position: relative; width: 140px; height: 140px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .bouncing {
            animation: bounceSpin 1.5s cubic-bezier(0.28, 0.84, 0.42, 1) forwards;
        }
        
        @keyframes bounceSpin {
            0% { transform: translateY(-400px) rotate(0deg) scale(0.5); opacity: 0; }
            25% { transform: translateY(50px) rotate(180deg) scale(1.2); opacity: 1; }
            50% { transform: translateY(-100px) rotate(360deg) scale(1); }
            75% { transform: translateY(20px) rotate(540deg) scale(1.1); }
            100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(720deg) scale(1.5); }
        }
        
        .dice-icon { transition: opacity 0.2s; }
        .dice-text {
            position: absolute; font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: white; 
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; display: none; text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);
        }
        .dice-container.show-result .dice-text { display: block; }
        .dice-container.show-result .dice-icon { opacity: 0.7; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="antialiased pb-24 selection:bg-emerald-500 selection:text-white relative min-h-screen">

    <!-- Header fixo -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800 pt-4 pb-3 px-4 shadow-md">
        <div class="max-w-md mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
            <div>
                <h1 class="font-title text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-400 leading-tight">Assassino Verde</h1>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium tracking-wider uppercase">Bárbaro 8 • Guardião Ancestral</p>
            </div>
            <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full border-2 border-emerald-500/50 bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(16,185,129,0.3)]">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-dragon"></i>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <main class="max-w-md mx-auto p-4 space-y-4">

        <!-- TAB 1: COMBATE -->
        <section id="tab-combat" class="tab-content active space-y-5">
            
            <!-- Quick Combat Stats Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2">
                <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-2.5 border border-slate-700 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center shadow-lg">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-slate-400 text-xs mb-1"></i>
                    <span class="text-[0.6rem] text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">CA</span>
                    <span class="text-xl font-bold text-white">15</span>
                    <span class="text-[0.5rem] text-slate-500">Sem Armadura</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-2.5 border border-slate-700 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-900/20 to-transparent"></div>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-emerald-400 text-xs mb-1 z-10"></i>
                    <span class="text-[0.6rem] text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold z-10">Iniciativa</span>
                    <span class="text-xl font-bold text-white z-10">+2</span>
                    <span class="text-[0.5rem] text-emerald-400 font-bold z-10">Vantagem</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-2.5 border border-slate-700 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center shadow-lg">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-person-running text-slate-400 text-xs mb-1"></i>
                    <span class="text-[0.6rem] text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Desloc.</span>
                    <span class="text-xl font-bold text-white">12m</span>
                    <span class="text-[0.5rem] text-slate-500">Rápido</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-2.5 border border-slate-700 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center shadow-lg">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-eye text-slate-400 text-xs mb-1"></i>
                    <span class="text-[0.6rem] text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Percepção</span>
                    <span class="text-xl font-bold text-white">13</span>
                    <span class="text-[0.5rem] text-slate-500">Passiva</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- HP & Temp HP Tracker -->
            <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-slate-700 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-slate-900">
                    <div id="hp-bar" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 to-emerald-500 transition-all duration-500 ease-out" style="width: 100%;"></div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1 mt-1">
                    <span class="text-[0.65rem] text-slate-400 font-title uppercase tracking-widest">Pontos de Vida</span>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-slate-900/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-700">
                        <span class="text-[0.6rem] text-blue-400 font-bold uppercase">PV Temp:</span>
                        <span id="temp-hp-display" class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-300">0</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex justify-center items-baseline gap-2 mb-3">
                    <span id="current-hp-display" class="text-5xl font-bold text-white drop-shadow-md">85</span>
                    <span class="text-lg text-slate-500 font-bold">/ 85</span>
                </div>

                <!-- HP Controls -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-6 gap-1 mb-2">
                    <button onclick="modifyHP(-10)" class="bg-red-950/60 hover:bg-red-900 text-red-300 font-bold py-2 rounded-lg border border-red-900/50 text-xs active:scale-95 touch-manipulation">-10</button>
                    <button onclick="modifyHP(-5)" class="bg-red-950/40 hover:bg-red-900 text-red-400 font-bold py-2 rounded-lg border border-red-900/50 text-xs active:scale-95 touch-manipulation">-5</button>
                    <button onclick="modifyHP(-1)" class="bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-slate-200 font-bold py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-600 text-xs active:scale-95 touch-manipulation">-1</button>
                    <button onclick="modifyHP(1)" class="bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-slate-200 font-bold py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-600 text-xs active:scale-95 touch-manipulation">+1</button>
                    <button onclick="modifyHP(5)" class="bg-emerald-950/40 hover:bg-emerald-900 text-emerald-400 font-bold py-2 rounded-lg border border-emerald-900/50 text-xs active:scale-95 touch-manipulation">+5</button>
                    <button onclick="modifyHP(10)" class="bg-emerald-950/60 hover:bg-emerald-900 text-emerald-300 font-bold py-2 rounded-lg border border-emerald-900/50 text-xs active:scale-95 touch-manipulation">+10</button>
                </div>

                <!-- Temp HP Quick Modifier -->
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center pt-2 border-t border-slate-700/60 text-xs">
                    <span class="text-slate-400 text-[0.7rem]">Ajustar PV Temp:</span>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <button onclick="modifyTempHP(-1)" class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 rounded text-slate-300 font-bold">-</button>
                        <button onclick="modifyTempHP(1)" class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 rounded text-blue-400 font-bold">+</button>
                        <button onclick="clearTempHP()" class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 rounded text-slate-400 text-[0.65rem]">Zerar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Death Saves (shown automatically if HP == 0) -->
                <div id="death-saves-box" class="mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-red-900/40 hidden">
                    <p class="text-[0.65rem] text-red-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-center mb-2">Testes Contra a Morte</p>
                    <div class="flex justify-around items-center">
                        <div>
                            <span class="text-[0.6rem] text-emerald-400 block mb-1 font-bold">SUCESSOS</span>
                            <div class="flex gap-1.5" id="death-successes">
                                <span onclick="toggleDeathSave('s', 0)" class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center text-xs"></span>
                                <span onclick="toggleDeathSave('s', 1)" class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center text-xs"></span>
                                <span onclick="toggleDeathSave('s', 2)" class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center text-xs"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="text-[0.6rem] text-red-400 block mb-1 font-bold">FRACASSOS</span>
                            <div class="flex gap-1.5" id="death-failures">
                                <span onclick="toggleDeathSave('f', 0)" class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full border border-red-500 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center text-xs"></span>
                                <span onclick="toggleDeathSave('f', 1)" class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full border border-red-500 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center text-xs"></span>
                                <span onclick="toggleDeathSave('f', 2)" class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full border border-red-500 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center text-xs"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Long Rest Trigger -->
                <div class="mt-3 text-center">
                    <button onclick="openRestModal()" class="text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 mx-auto transition-colors">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-campground text-emerald-500"></i> Descanso Longo (Restaurar Tudo)
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Fúria & Dados de Vida -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3">
                <!-- Fúria Tracker -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-3.5 border border-emerald-900/40 shadow-lg">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
                        <h3 class="font-title text-emerald-400 text-xs tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-fire text-amber-500"></i> Fúria (4 usos / Descanso Longo)
                        </h3>
                        <span id="rage-status-badge" class="text-[0.65rem] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold bg-slate-900 text-slate-400">INATIVA</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-around items-center my-2" id="rage-container">
                        <!-- Dots rendered by JS -->
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-[0.65rem] text-slate-400 bg-slate-900/60 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-700/50 mt-2 space-y-0.5">
                        <p>• <b>Benefícios:</b> +2 dano corpo a corpo com FOR, resistência a dano cortante, perfurante e concussão, vantagem em testes e salvaguardas de FOR.</p>
                        <p>• <b>Restrições:</b> Não conjura nem mantém concentração. Dura 1 minuto.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Dados de Vida -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-3.5 border border-slate-700 shadow-lg">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
                        <h3 class="font-title text-slate-300 text-xs tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse text-red-400"></i> Dados de Vida (8d12)
                        </h3>
                        <span id="hd-counter-text" class="text-[0.65rem] text-slate-400">8 disponíveis</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-center" id="hd-container">
                        <!-- Dots rendered by JS -->
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Regras de Combate Rápido / Táticas -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-3 border border-slate-700 text-center">
                    <span class="text-[0.65rem] text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-bold block mb-1">Ataque Extra</span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400">2 Ataques / Ação</span>
                    <p class="text-[0.55rem] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Nível 5 de Bárbaro</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-3 border border-slate-700 text-center">
                    <span class="text-[0.65rem] text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-bold block mb-1">Ataque Imprudente</span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-400">Vantagem de FOR</span>
                    <p class="text-[0.55rem] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Inimigos ganham vant. contra você</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ARMAS E ATAQUES -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h3 class="font-title text-sm text-emerald-400 tracking-wider uppercase border-b border-slate-700 pb-1">
                    Ataques Disponíveis
                </h3>

                <!-- Arma 1: Machado de Prata Sepulcral -->
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-800 to-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-emerald-600/40 p-4 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <h4 class="font-title text-base font-bold text-white">Machado de Prata Sepulcral</h4>
                                <span class="text-[0.55rem] bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-700/50 px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded font-bold uppercase">Mágico</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-[0.65rem] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">2 Mãos • Alcance 1.5m • Golpeia espíritos incorpóreos</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-slate-950 px-2 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 text-center min-w-[3rem]">
                            <span class="block text-[0.55rem] text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold">Acerto</span>
                            <span class="text-base font-bold text-emerald-400">+8</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-300 mb-3 bg-slate-950/40 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                        <span>Dano: <b class="text-white" id="machado-dmg-text">1d10 + 5</b> cortante</span>
                        <span id="machado-rage-tag" class="text-amber-400 text-[0.65rem] font-bold hidden bg-amber-950/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-amber-800/40">+2 Fúria (+7 total)</span>
                    </div>

                    <button onclick="rollWeapon('machado')" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-title text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest py-3 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-all active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 touch-manipulation">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-dice-d20 text-base"></i> Rolar Machado (1d10)
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Arma 2: Azagaias (com rastreador de 4 unidades) -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 p-4 shadow-lg">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-title text-base font-bold text-white">Azagaia</h4>
                            <p class="text-[0.65rem] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Arremesso (9m / 36m) ou Corpo a corpo</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-slate-950 px-2 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 text-center min-w-[3rem]">
                            <span class="block text-[0.55rem] text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold">Acerto</span>
                            <span class="text-base font-bold text-emerald-400">+8</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-300 mb-2">
                        <span>Dano: <b class="text-white">1d6 + 5</b> perfurante</span>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <span class="text-[0.65rem] text-slate-400 uppercase">Qtd (4):</span>
                            <div class="flex gap-1" id="javelin-dots"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <button onclick="rollWeapon('azagaia')" class="w-full bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-slate-100 font-title text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-600 transition-all active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 touch-manipulation">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-crosshairs text-emerald-400"></i> Rolar Azagaia (1d6)
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Arma 3: Adaga -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 p-4 shadow-lg">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-title text-base font-bold text-white">Adaga</h4>
                            <p class="text-[0.65rem] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Leve • Acuidade • Arremesso (6m / 18m)</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-slate-950 px-2 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 text-center min-w-[3rem]">
                            <span class="block text-[0.55rem] text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold">Acerto</span>
                            <span class="text-base font-bold text-emerald-400">+8</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-300 mb-2">
                        <span>Dano: <b class="text-white">1d4 + 5</b> perfurante</span>
                    </div>

                    <button onclick="rollWeapon('adaga')" class="w-full bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-slate-100 font-title text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-600 transition-all active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 touch-manipulation">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-feather-pointed text-emerald-400"></i> Rolar Adaga (1d4)
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Ação Especial: Escudo Espiritual (Reação 2d6) -->
                <div class="bg-blue-950/30 rounded-xl border border-blue-500/40 p-3.5 shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-1">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield text-blue-400"></i>
                            <h4 class="font-title text-sm font-bold text-white">Escudo Espiritual</h4>
                        </div>
                        <span class="bg-blue-900/60 text-blue-300 text-[0.6rem] font-bold uppercase px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-blue-700/60">Reação • 9m</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[0.65rem] text-slate-300 leading-snug mb-3">
                        Enquanto em Fúria, use sua reação para <b>reduzir o dano</b> que OUTRA criatura visível a até 9m sofrer em <b>2d6</b>.
                    </p>
                    <button onclick="rollSpiritShield()" class="w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-title text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest py-2.5 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-all active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-dice"></i> Rolar Redução (2d6)
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Ordem de Jogo / Guia Tático (Página 3 do PDF) -->
            <details class="bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 overflow-hidden shadow">
                <summary class="p-3 text-xs font-title font-bold text-emerald-400 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center select-none">
                    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-list mr-1.5"></i> Guia Rápido: Ordem de Combate Sugerida</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-slate-400 text-xs"></i>
                </summary>
                <div class="p-3 bg-slate-900/70 text-xs text-slate-300 space-y-2 border-t border-slate-700 text-[0.7rem] leading-relaxed">
